mechanics.update({'corrosion_scythe': 'Basic hits queue 28 physical attack-effect damage and stack a target-local 8% slow up to 40% for 1.5 seconds (half strength for ranged carriers). Eligible Golden Staff repeats contribute attack effects and stacks. Shared Impulse grants 6% Attack Speed per stack, up to 30%, for 3 seconds; stronger finished Impulse supersedes Swift Crossbow.', 'endless_battle': 'A detected Skill 1, Skill 2 or Ultimate cooldown start arms the next basic hit for 3 seconds. It queues 60% total Attack true damage and heals 28 + 40% total Attack. Cooldown: 1.5 seconds. Cooldown transitions approximate cast events.', 'golden_staff': 'Converts observed initial non-equipment crit plus current catalog equipment crit to Attack Speed and suppresses crit. Every third non-critical basic hit repeats eligible DHS/Corrosion/Crossbow/Feather attack effects twice and grants 80% Attack Speed for 0.5 seconds. It does not triple the original attack. TFM2 limits: same-tick/target hits share an event; later non-equipment crit changes, hero skill attack-effect inheritance and attack-speed-cap overrides are not fully modeled.', 'hunter_strike': 'Five hits on the same champion or monster grant 50% Movement Speed decaying to zero over 3 seconds. Cooldown: 8 seconds. Ordinary lane minions and towers do not qualify.', 'malefic_roar': 'Native penetration policy: shared Armor Buster grants 30% Physical Penetration once across Malefic Roar and Malefic Gun; Roar adds target Armor / 10, capped at 30%, for that hit. No lingering target-derived penetration buff.', 'malefic_gun': 'Shared Armor Buster grants 30% Physical Penetration, without stacking a second copy from Malefic Roar. Basic hits grant 10% Movement Speed and +4 attack range for 0.5 seconds. The range rule is still a TFM2 approximation.', 'sea_halberd': 'Damage applies shared Lifebane: 40% less healing and newly gained shields for 3 seconds. Existing shield layers are preserved. Deal 8% more hit damage against targets with higher total maximum HP; total HP remains the TFM2 substitute for bonus HP.', 'war_axe': 'Dealing non-recursive damage gains +4 Attack per stack, at most once per second, up to 6 stacks for 4 seconds. At full stacks, every eligible hit queues 10% extra true damage. True item procs cannot recursively trigger it. MLBB role penalties are not yet modeled.', 'wind_of_nature': 'Automatic active: taking damage while already below 30% HP activates physical-damage immunity for 90-second cooldown. Duration: 2 seconds for the TFM2 Range class, 1 second otherwise. The native landing hook blocks physical skills and basic hits; magic basic attacks and true damage remain effective. No manual item button.', 'clock_of_destiny': 'Magic champion hits gain timed defensive stacks, at most once per 0.4 seconds, up to 6 for 5 seconds. Each stack grants 4.5 + 0.5 per level Armor and Magic Resist. Shared Gift: below half HP, restore 15% max HP over 3 seconds, once per 60 seconds. Clock supersedes Elegant Gem; no mana effect.', 'concentrated_energy': 'Magic damage gains +3 Magic Power per timed stack, at most once per 0.4 seconds, up to 6 for 5 seconds. At full stacks every eligible magic hit deals 12% more damage; the stack acquisition interval does not gate the damage bonus.', 'divine_glaive': 'Native penetration policy applies 40% Magic Penetration plus target Magic Resist / 10, capped at another 20%, to that hit. Flat magic penetration is separate and applied after percentage penetration.', 'feather_of_heaven': 'Basic hits queue 18 + 30% total Magic Power magic attack-effect damage. Shared Impulse grants 6% Attack Speed per stack, up to 30%, for 3 seconds. Golden Staff repeats eligible effects; stronger finished Impulse supersedes Swift Crossbow.', 'flask_of_the_oasis': 'Grants 12% outgoing heal/shield power on attributed native casts. An actual ally heal or attributed native shield starts a 3-second Blessing window. Below 35% HP during the window, grant a 35-per-caster-level shield for 3 seconds and reduce caster Skill 1/2 cooldowns by 2 seconds. Cooldown: 60 seconds per recipient. Direct SDK shields lack caster attribution: they receive incoming Oracle/Lifebane, but cannot independently start Blessing or receive outgoing power.', 'genius_wand': 'Magic champion damage applies target-local Magic Resist reduction stacks: 2 + level / 3 per stack, up to 3 for 2 seconds. Flat magic penetration is applied separately by the native policy.', 'glowing_wand': 'Damage applies shared Lifebane: 40% less healing and newly gained shields for 3 seconds. Non-item magic hits additionally burn for 1% target max HP per second for 3 seconds. Burn damage can refresh Lifebane and interact with defensive magic passives without restarting its own burn indefinitely.', 'holy_crystal': 'Gain 21% to 35% additional Magic Power, scaling from carrier level 1 to 15.', 'ice_queen_wand': 'Champion skill hits apply a target-local 10% slow per stack, up to 30%, for 2 seconds. At most one stack per target per 0.4 seconds; expired counters restart at one.', 'starlium_scythe': 'A detected Skill 1, Skill 2 or Ultimate cooldown start arms the next basic hit for 3 seconds. It queues 30 + 60% total Magic Power true damage and a 15% slow for 1.5 seconds. Cooldown: 1.5 seconds. Crisis and Endless Battle Divine Justice have separate identities.', 'wishing_lantern': 'Each target accumulates eligible resolved magic-hit damage separately. Every 315 damage queues a magic proc equal to 8% current target HP. Multiple thresholds can proc from one hit (32 immediate enqueues maximum, excess retained). Each queued proc re-reads current HP; item procs cannot recursively accumulate themselves.', 'antique_cuirass': 'Skill damage applies shared, attacker-local Deter for 2 seconds: each stack reduces subsequent physical damage by 8%, up to 24%. It does not reduce Attack or magic damage. Stronger Deter supersedes Dreadnaught Armor. Native policy starts the reduction after the triggering simulation tick.', 'brute_force_breastplate': 'Dealing eligible damage gains a timed stack once per second, up to 6 for 4 seconds. Each gives either +2 Attack or +3 Magic Power (chosen from current total offensive stats), and +2% Movement Speed. At full stacks gain 25% Tenacity. Bonus-stat adaptive selection remains a TFM2 approximation.', 'chastise_pauldron': 'Taking damage reduces the attacker to 80% of observed normal Attack Speed for 2 seconds, accounting for an existing copy of the same debuff. This models speed strength; MLBB attack-speed-cap changes are not implemented. Surviving below 30% HP restores 20% max HP over 2 seconds, once per 60 seconds.', 'guardian_helmet': 'After 5 seconds without dealing champion damage or taking damage, recover 2.5% max HP per second. The native landing hook queues a heal for 30% + a calibrated max-HP term of resolved damage above 175; healing occurs next tick only if alive. A lethal hit remains lethal. This is a healing refund, not immunity.', 'oracle': 'Native recipient policy raises incoming healing and new shields by 25%, including direct SDK shields, regeneration and vamp. Lifebane reduces the new shield once; existing shields are preserved. No fake flat regeneration bonus.', 'radiant_armor': 'Taking magic damage, including item damage, gains timed Magic Resist stacks: 3 + level / 2 per stack, up to 6 for 5 seconds, at most one per 0.4 seconds. Expired stacks restart at one. Flat resistance is the calibrated TFM2 rule; Radiant Armor is unrelated to the Mythical tier name.', 'valkyries_shield': 'Athena/Valkyrie alias: the first magic hit starts a 3-second window with 25% magic damage reduction, including that first hit. Rearms after 5 seconds without a magic hit. Uses the verified native landing hook, rather than a delayed Magic Resist buff.', 'elegant_gem': 'Shared Gift: below half HP, restore 15% max HP over 3 seconds, once per 60 seconds. Clock of Destiny supersedes this component effect. No mana effect.', 'dreadnaught_armor': 'Skill damage applies shared, attacker-local Deter: 4% less subsequent physical damage per stack, up to 12%, for 2 seconds. Antique Cuirass supersedes it. Native policy starts after the triggering simulation tick.', 'black_ice_shield': 'Every half second gain +3 Armor and Magic Resist per enemy champion within 42.6 range, capped at +15. Shares Fortress Shield identity with Dominance Ice, whose stronger effect takes precedence.', 'swift_crossbow': 'Basic hits queue 14 adaptive attack-effect damage (magic if current total Magic Power exceeds Attack). Shared Impulse adds 3% Attack Speed per stack, up to 15% for 3 seconds. Finished Impulse supersedes the component; eligible Golden Staff effects repeat.'})
